{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:00 2026-07-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:00 2026-07-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:00 2026-07-19 HKT</p><p>文家良昨日六十九歲生日，人緣甚佳的他，獲得家人、馬主朋友在中環會所為他慶祝生日，馬主方面有「自強不息」、「君子」、「隨想曲」等馬主王宗彥及其太太、「鼓浪」系馬主吳濤、「果然」系馬主黎劍威、「牛精」系王永強的太太及兒子等多位馬主到場祝賀，馬主和家人都為文家良準備了三個生日蛋糕，又齊齊唱生日歌，氣氛熾熱，大家都過了開心盡慶的一晚。</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img alt=\"文家良和太太\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b416a34d7376594fdf58b9f5a7042374/2026-07/1c387b29-07e4-4a93-ba7e-a776b4182279_1_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"文家良和家人合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d393e2912f5a3786ee58036ae86d28bf/2026-07/2e9b5c6a-f22f-4453-9d2b-bae895105bbe_1_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e67cdff13d3c886b41e77bf522647b47/2026-07/5f0fe028-0e42-4d0a-8f6f-5b1c4014f2ef_1_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/13ac6b497daf4af77c353c9c680bf167/2026-07/6f12a49e-1389-40b5-a8de-c0f4934f9b8c.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/535b8bb8db8d072efd6bce86d450b107/2026-07/8bf8b3ab-73a6-4e59-98b0-34e234a347c8.jpg\"/><img alt=\"「閃電小子」馬主陳厚寶（左一）及「鼓浪」系馬主吳濤（左三）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/da110b2eac38c0019b90b543a3740c7e/2026-07/01829c53-e3e3-4bab-9fba-24c8b7be463d.jpg\"/><img alt=\"馬主黎劍威和馬主王宗彦\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6c42f1146354052dd17c681a08b0bada/2026-07/2989659d-6221-4ac5-9058-7679579b1c00.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/289d9b54e59d94d6ed14999dcc9d21ac/2026-07/a3f5d2e5-ae46-47af-84fb-8498383cdf29.jpg\"/><img alt=\"前練馬師甘光達（右五）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e105fa518e3676d4782c9b1d98193877/2026-07/ac90046e-605a-456a-8bfd-d40b6888f808_1_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c74546382335ff4990d02e1a51ebbbc5/2026-07/b1c390ea-c7b2-492b-a5d2-c9cc709c49cd.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9a3f53d53f38f471ac0040c4eef255ab/2026-07/ba9a6e25-5aef-4387-a178-e269123a3691.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9436a046d9276c48d1f712bc98c61ad8/2026-07/be809c6b-ab5b-49a2-90ef-577c089f332d.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ed61a9e023527c74dbdffb275aff467a/2026-07/d0b070da-d589-4cab-a896-c537b3dfb84b.jpg\"/><img alt=\"文家良錫其媽媽，最左邊是文家良女兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/614183f126316763ad8380c8c5e6c6e1/2026-07/edae9d95-ea2e-4032-a423-940f916fe720.jpg\"/><p>陳嘉甜</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-19T07:16:49.318692+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":261,"images":14,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}